          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I get a subscription on my cartridges?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we offer a subscription to replace your cartridges to save you time and headspace.<br/>Set up automatic cartridge delivery — save 10% →<a href=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.co.uk/products/kokocarb_cartridges?selling_plan=738775466368&variant=57619826246016\" title=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.co.uk/products/kokocarb_cartridges?selling_plan=738775466368&variant=57619826246016\"> [Subscribe now]</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YNCkyE": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I make changes to my subscription?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Your subscription can be amended and updated from your Phoenix Gravity Account. Once you’ve logged into your account, click on subscriptions to make any changes. If you need any further help, please don’t hesitate to<a href=\"/pages/contact\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"New Contact Us\"> contact us</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_AQ6Nne": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I skip or cancel my subscription?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, you can make changes to frequency or cancel your subscription at any time. Please note that cancelling your subscription will forfeit any special pricing on your subscription, so if you wish to re-subscribe after canceling, you may not be able to recover the same special pricing you had previously. Need help with your subscription? <a href=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.co.uk/pages/contact\" title=\"https://phoenixwaterfilters.co.uk/pages/contact\">Contact us</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
